1
00:00:00,880 --> 00:00:02,340
Minato.

2
00:00:02,340 --> 00:00:04,550
You like Haru, don't you?

3
00:00:09,260 --> 00:00:10,250
This whole time,

4
00:00:10,250 --> 00:00:13,350
I could feel
your feelings for him.

5
00:00:14,470 --> 00:00:16,270
It was so obvious.

6
00:00:16,270 --> 00:00:17,230
You know, I used to

7
00:00:17,230 --> 00:00:19,060
have a huge crush on Haru, too.

8
00:00:20,480 --> 00:00:21,700
Really?!

9
00:00:22,480 --> 00:00:23,860
But...

10
00:00:23,860 --> 00:00:25,190
For a guy to feel this way

11
00:00:25,190 --> 00:00:26,110
about another guy...

12
00:00:26,110 --> 00:00:27,860
What's wrong with that?

13
00:00:28,530 --> 00:00:29,570
But...

14
00:00:29,570 --> 00:00:30,990
Haru's acting...

15
00:00:30,990 --> 00:00:32,740
It's like he's responding to your feelings.

16
00:00:32,740 --> 00:00:34,530
His performance has reached a whole new level.

17
00:00:35,410 --> 00:00:36,490
Your feelings

18
00:00:36,490 --> 00:00:38,370
must have definitely reached him.

19
00:00:41,670 --> 00:00:44,290
Honestly, I'm a little jealous.

20
00:00:44,290 --> 00:00:45,420
Because I could never

21
00:00:45,420 --> 00:00:47,550
bring out that side of him.

22
00:00:49,590 --> 00:00:50,630
But that's okay.

23
00:00:51,010 --> 00:00:51,970
I'm going to

24
00:00:51,970 --> 00:00:53,550
play Olivia in a way

25
00:00:53,550 --> 00:00:55,810
only I can.

26
00:00:56,560 --> 00:00:58,770
Let's give it our all.

27
00:01:00,890 --> 00:01:01,960
Okay!

28
00:01:02,560 --> 00:01:03,770
You need to use Viola

29
00:01:03,770 --> 00:01:06,070
to convey your love to Haru.

30
00:01:06,070 --> 00:01:08,110
Convey my love...

31
00:01:09,320 --> 00:01:10,610
If you don't,

32
00:01:10,610 --> 00:01:12,960
I might just steal him away.

33
00:01:20,000 --> 00:01:22,250
Give me excess of it,

34
00:01:22,670 --> 00:01:24,830
that the appetite of love
may surfeit and die.
